{"title":"会长赖铭华会见省项目管理学会秘书长柯建杰","date":"2017-11-16","content":"<p>\r\n\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p align=\"center\" class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:center\">\r\n\t<b><span style=\"font-size:21.0pt;font-family:宋体\">会长赖铭华会见省项目管理学会秘书长柯建杰<span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></b></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">\r\n\t<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;font-family:宋体\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent:28.0pt;mso-char-indent-count:2.0\">\r\n\t<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;font-family:宋体\">11</span><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;font-family:宋体\">月<span lang=\"EN-US\">15</span>日，会长赖铭华会见了应邀到访的广东省项目管理学会秘书长柯建杰博士一行，双方就加强我省项目管理领域交流合作、促进资源共享优势互补等展开深入探讨，就建立长效沟通机制、共同推动行业创新发展等达成共识。并初步议定，双方将在行业论坛、宣贯活动、商务对接、技术创新等多领域展开深入合作，自<span lang=\"EN-US\">2018</span>年起将全面实施，共同开创我省项目管理行业新格局！</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent:28.0pt;mso-char-indent-count:2.0\">\r\n\t<span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;font-family:宋体\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent:28.0pt;mso-char-indent-count:2.0\">\r\n\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">\r\n\t&nbsp;<img alt=\"\" src=\"https://www.gpma.org.cn/userfiles/8482ba15209b475ab73c26fc0c003d00/images/cms/article/201711/%E4%B8%A4%E4%BC%9A%E5%90%88%E7%85%A7%E4%BA%8C_%E5%89%AF%E6%9C%AC.jpg\" /></p>\r\n<p align=\"center\" class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:center\">\r\n\t<span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:宋体;color:#262626;mso-themecolor:text1;\r\nmso-themetint:217;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#262626;mso-style-textfill-fill-themecolor:\r\ntext1;mso-style-textfill-fill-alpha:100.0%;mso-style-textfill-fill-colortransforms:\r\n&quot;lumm=85000 lumo=15000&quot;\">赖铭华会长与省项目管理学会秘书长柯建杰博士<span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent:28.0pt;mso-char-indent-count:2.0\">\r\n\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent:28.0pt;mso-char-indent-count:2.0\">\r\n\t<span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;font-family:宋体\">广东省项目管理学会市场部陈红等陪同到访，秘书处策划部陈炽明、科信部邓剑峰、行政部徐涵雪、广东永道工程咨询有限公司项目管理部李臻群等同志参与了交流。</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent:28.0pt;mso-char-indent-count:2.0\">\r\n\t<span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;font-family:宋体\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">\r\n\t<img alt=\"\" src=\"https://www.gpma.org.cn/userfiles/8482ba15209b475ab73c26fc0c003d00/images/cms/article/201711/%E5%BE%AE%E4%BF%A1%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87_20171115170813_%E5%89%AF%E6%9C%AC(1).jpg\" /></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">\r\n\t<img alt=\"\" src=\"https://www.gpma.org.cn/userfiles/8482ba15209b475ab73c26fc0c003d00/images/cms/article/201711/%E4%B8%A4%E4%BC%9A%E5%90%88%E7%85%A7_%E5%89%AF%E6%9C%AC.jpg\" /></p>\r\n<p>\r\n\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>\r\n\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>\r\n\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>\r\n\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>\r\n\t&nbsp;</p>"}